# game packages
packages-game/**/node_modules/
packages-game/**/dist/
packages-game/**/*.js
packages-game/**/*.d.ts
packages-game/**/package-lock.json
# 例外：GM 后台静态前端是源码而非构建产物，必须入库（否则面板脚本静默漏提）
!packages-game/game-server/admin/**/*.js
# 例外：客户端 vendor 的第三方运行时与引擎类型声明是零依赖方案的一部分，必须入库
!packages-game/game-client/vendor/**/*.js
!packages-game/game-client/src/**/*.d.ts
# 例外：mock-redis 是本地无 Redis 环境的开发替身脚本（非构建产物），必须入库
!packages-game/game-server/scripts/*.js
# 场景配置包产物由服务端发布时写盘，不入库；仅用 .gitkeep 占位托管目录
packages-game/game-server/gamedata/*
!packages-game/game-server/gamedata/.gitkeep

